 "note": "Each program is built under every level of its toolchain, once as a native program (with the native driver) and once as a WebAssembly module of its kernel. {tool} is the chosen compiler, {opt} the level, {src} the source, {driver} the C driver, {out} the output file. A C compiler is chosen from candidates: the first whose wasm build of a probe kernel succeeds is used for both builds; when none can build wasm, the first that builds natively is used and ε is not counted for C. eps_input is the n of the kernel call whose ε is counted and whose energy is measured; inputs are the declared inputs of the equivalence evidence.",
